                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very meticoulosly done platfromer that was clearly inspired by Super Meat Boy and Battletoads in some cases. The art is great, the music is awesome, the animations are so good... And of course the story, it makes you think and re-evaluate some things in life. Not too hard, not too easy to learn. Normal gameplay is infinite lives and checkpoints, but once you master the game it's all about speedrunning each level and it takes some trial and error. Once you're done with that - an ultimate challenge comes which is Pilgramige Mode with its permadeath feature. You die once - you lose and you have to play the whole game from the start. Once you're done with all of that congrats to you - you earned the title of Master Jedi (unlike Anakin).",
